clean_summary:
Starting from the basics for this new series on training agents. Agents are obviously writing most of our code, but we still need to understand the core of what we're doing. I reckon there will always be a core set of lines that we need to grasp to build at scale. For training an agent, that starts from this simple fine-tuning loop.

The YouTube series is on 'Training Agents', which is way bigger than this. But starting here should onboard a load of people and give us a nice base to work from.

@ben_burtenshaw
